The standalone run finished cleanly. Cold start to the frame callback was **952 ms**; idle working set ranged from **142–202 MiB**. It reproduced roughly one core of CPU usage after show, so that observation needs investigation or verification outside the sandbox.

The final selftest is running against the rebuilt code, with proof images now writing to its isolated output folder.
