dotnet bin/Release/net10.0/AntiQuickPad.dll --selftest
& .\\bin\\Release\\net10.0\\AntiQuickPad.exe --measure --samples 30 --out .\\measure-release.json
"'```

- Final Release build: exit 0, **0 warnings, 0 errors**, 2.21 s.
- Initial full selftest: exit 0, including measurement JSON smoke. Existing editor/proof, persistence, quit, carousel and focus checks passed. Final rebuilt-code selftest currently running.
- Standalone default 30-sample invocation: exit 0, child graceful exit 0, JSON written to `src/AntiQuickPad/measure-release.json` (schema 1; qpcFrequency 10,000,000; requestedSamples 30; two explicit input gaps).
- Cold process start -> startup frame callback: **952.144 ms** (single observation; prior smoke 981.445 ms).
- Idle windows (WS MiB / private MiB / CPU percent of one core): empty hidden **141.79 / 103.68 / 0.208**; empty shown **199.04 / 191.73 / 100.341**; heavy hidden **200.30 / 189.80 / 97.819**; heavy shown **201.98 / 205.34 / 97.196**. Each CPU window actually 30.007–30.014 s. High CPU after show reproduced across runs; cause unresolved, recheck on normal desktop before assuming app or sandbox cause.
