## Exact gaps / manager action

SendInput **0/6**, last-error **5 (Access denied)** in both empty and heavy first warmups. Alternate Ctrl+Alt+F9 registration succeeded, error 0. No WM_HOTKEY received; no foreground-confirmed focus event. Input sampling stops on the first blocked warmup in each state; actual retained n=0 despite requested n=30. Esc is not injected without confirmed foreground focus. All input->hotkey, input->focus, input->frame-callback and Esc->hidden distributions remain null. Resource metrics still run fully. These gaps are recorded in JSON; successful harness exit does not mean timing budget passed.

**<100 ms budget UNVERIFIED**, not a pass or failure. RequestAnimationFrame is a render opportunity and can precede drawing; compositor presentation/scanout and physical keyboard transport are outside this harness's evidence.

